      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "common_0090_rival_14",
      "hash64": "DE914474D9A258C1",
      "text": "Es gibt da eine App, die du unbedingt brauchst!\\c\\nHast du dein Handy dabei? Dann installier ich\\nsie schnell für dich![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "common_0090_system_01",
      "hash64": "880C090D93989D66",
      "text": "Du kannst jetzt auf deinem Smart-Rotom den\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Pokédex[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] aufrufen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "common_0090_rival_15",
      "hash64": "DE914374D9A2570E",
      "text": "Der Pokédex registriert automatisch all die\\nPokémon, die du fängst.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "common_0090_rival_16",
      "hash64": "DE914274D9A2555B",
      "text": "Für einen Pokémon-Trainer ist die App ein Muss!\\nSeñor Jim, einer der Lehrer an unserer Akademie,\\r\\nwar mit für ihre Entwicklung verantwortlich![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "F3A81DA8F42150A1",
      "text": "Zu meiner Zeit haben wir noch alles per Hand in\\nunsere Notizbücher eingetragen.\\c\\nDie Welt ist schon um einiges praktischer\\ngeworden.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "common_0090_rival_17",
      "hash64": "DE914174D9A253A8",
      "text": "Das kann ich mir gar nicht vorstellen... Alles per\\nHand zu schreiben ist doch viel zu umständlich![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "common_0090_head_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "F3A81CA8F4214EEE",
      "text": "Haha... Wohl wahr![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
